- **Industrials**: More scattered, reflecting the diversity within the sector (e.g., logistics, construction, machinery).
- **Real Estate** and **Utilities**: Tend to form looser clusters, with fewer companies and more general descriptions.

>  Sectors with focused, domain-specific vocabularies form tighter clusters. Broader sectors with many business types (like Industrials) show more spread.

